  "implementation": [
    "Exactly three additive inherent operations: FullLoopControl and TransmitterPreviewControl return existing ApiResult<RetainedFootprint>; upstream RunControl returns existing PhyResult<RetainedFootprint>. Common cancellation gains only the existing hidden support-trait visitor, with no fourth inherent method.",
    "Each DS footprint is root + private Shared + common AtomicBool, two roots/zero entries. US is root + private State, one root; optional shared common cancellation adds only its atomic and one root. Exact compiled layouts include the existing test-only US field in owner tests; direct Rust/native reference uses production layouts.",
    "Exhaustive field/enum audits reuse checked metadata sums. No source cloning, clock reads, lifecycle transitions, atomic stores, claim, Condvar wait/notify or new scientific implementation. US progress/pause guards never overlap; poison recovery follows existing owner behavior.",
    "Three existing native classes release the interpreter and return the existing immutable common quantity type through current structured error conversion. Stubs and legacy root/directional aliases remain. No manifest, dependency, namespace registration or Qt adapter changes.",
    "Facade tests preserve exact legacy method types and independent direction feature builds. A direct Rust process in the existing CLI crate uses its existing serde_json dependency; no facade dependency is added."
  ],
